    "status": "ok",
    "summary": "The Northfield Research Vault retains daily snapshots for 35 days. Deleted files remain recoverable by project owners for 30 days and by OIT backup administrators for an additional five days. This information is sourced from the Approved Cloud Services Registry, section 3.1.",
